nd north  macedonia deserve it  and we will all stand to gain  when one day  we welcome albania and north macedonia  as full fledged members of our european  union  thank you  thank you very much and now prime  minister fiala the floor is yours  at the end dimitar ladies and gentlemen  on behalf of czech presidency of the  council of  the eu  i congratulate both your countries north  macedonia and albania  on this milestone  we all will be stronger for your clear  european choice which has been tested a  few times already  facing the russian aggression we highly  appreciate that you fully stand with the  eu common foreign policy and security  policy  in the europe of today  we must be united more than ever  czechia always supported a future new  membership of western balkans and will  remain so  we are honored that such a progress  takes part during our presidency however  we have to thank to the french  presidency for all their hard work and  dedication that led us to this historic  moment  the czech republic and whole central  europe know well the importance of the  eu integration for our democracy  security and development of our economy  the european union future is within you  your reach  i wish you the swiftest possible pass to  our european union family  thank you very much prime minister rama  the floor is yours  thank you uh we will have to speak  several times today so  i'd like  to start in this very morning with some  thanks  and of course  i  want to thank first and foremost  the president of the commission  ursula  who  knew  how to  [Music]  become  a german balkan  [Music]  presence in this uh building and to who  fights  for both to fight for  you and to fight for the western balkans  to fight for  all the member states  and to fight for us  aspiring to be members  and in the meantime i want to thank  another german lady who is not anymore  in business but  without her we would not have been here  today angela merkel and  she just had her birthday i